    "created_at": "2022-06-14T19:24:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-06-14T19:24:48Z",
    "body": "I'm unsure about this.\r\n\r\nI think the current abstraction is reasonable in that if we were to add something in the future that had input activation behavior, and had readonly-ness, we might want to preserve the separation here.\r\n\r\nOn the other hand, I think we generally only want to add input activation behavior to \"button-like\", not \"text-like\" things, so such a future scenario seems unlikely...\r\n\r\nI'd accept a PR for this change, if you think it'd be an improvement and nobody else has any strong feelings.",
